Third-party material
--------------------

src/status/codes.ts contains the file and record error codes, names, descriptions and
requested actions copied without change from:
  OECD (2025), Crypto-Asset Reporting Framework Status Message XML Schema: User Guide for
  Tax Administrations, OECD Publishing, Paris, https://doi.org/10.1787/e528d7f5-en.
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

The plain-language element names in src/translate/labels.ts and the rule descriptions in
src/rules/catalogue.ts are based on the Status Message user guide above and on:
  OECD (2025), Crypto-Asset Reporting Framework XML Schema (July 2025): User Guide for Tax
  Administrations, OECD Publishing, Paris, https://doi.org/10.1787/6e60235b-en.
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International.

The code lists and their descriptions in src/generated/ are derived from the OECD CARF XML
Schema v1.5 (July 2025) and the CARF Status Message XML Schema v1.1 (June 2025). The OECD
XSD files themselves are not included in this package.
